  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>As a (contemplation) talent, you gain 2 points of introspection.</p>\n<p>Whenever you attempt an ability check, attack roll, saving throw, or skill check, you can spend up to 2 points of introspection (+1 per 5 associated ranks) to add an equivalent insight bonus to the attempt—or twice as much when applied to an ability check or skill check. This bonus stacks with the insight bonus granted by enduring an effect, and can be applied after the results of the roll, which can change a failure to a success.</p>\n<p><strong>Utility Option:</strong> You can take this talent as a utility talent by having it only be able to apply to skill checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Meditation Master (<em>Faiths and Philosophies</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
